{"4077800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Silly Survivors", "steam_appid": 4077800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/4828dd786a477b5c89f125f0cb70b552.poster.avif?t=1773561856\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/4828dd786a477b5c89f125f0cb70b552.webm?t=1773561856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/4828dd786a477b5c89f125f0cb70b552.mp4?t=1773561856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦊 Silly Survivors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an adorable  furry fox, armed with… a flashlight! Survive hordes of suspiciously silly ghosts who keep trying to get close (and pull some kind of silly stuff). Light is your main weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/5af14a2b183792e49e4f54c248ca2ae8.poster.avif?t=1773561856\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/5af14a2b183792e49e4f54c248ca2ae8.webm?t=1773561856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/5af14a2b183792e49e4f54c248ca2ae8.mp4?t=1773561856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique protagonist</strong> - a furry fox. worth it, isn't it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silly ghosts</strong> - they’re silly, they’re fluffy, and that’s exactly why they’re twice as dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival gameplay</strong> - keep your light on, or you’ll meet… a very strange death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and buffs</strong> - power up your flashlight, widen its radius, and invent new ways to deal with furry ghosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong> - you can literally shoot furries with a flashlight. What could be better?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/4828dd786a477b5c89f125f0cb70b552.poster.avif?t=1773561856\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/4828dd786a477b5c89f125f0cb70b552.webm?t=1773561856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/4828dd786a477b5c89f125f0cb70b552.mp4?t=1773561856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦊 Silly Survivors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an adorable  furry fox, armed with… a flashlight! Survive hordes of suspiciously silly ghosts who keep trying to get close (and pull some kind of silly stuff). Light is your main weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/5af14a2b183792e49e4f54c248ca2ae8.poster.avif?t=1773561856\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/5af14a2b183792e49e4f54c248ca2ae8.webm?t=1773561856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st